flowchart TD
  REQ[HTTPS Request] --> NR[Normalize Host / trusted proxy boundary]
  NR --> RESERVED{Reserved admin host?}
  RESERVED -->|yes| ADMIN[Session auth / platform routes]
  RESERVED -->|no| MATCH{Exact active hostname binding?}
  MATCH -->|yes| CF{Cloudflare hostname + SSL active?}
  CF -->|yes| TEN{Organization active?}
  CF -->|no| FAIL[421 or 404 no fallback]
  TEN -->|yes| DEST[Resolve destination org event edition]
  TEN -->|no| SUSP[Safe suspended page]
  MATCH -->|no| SUB{Platform subdomain known?}
  SUB -->|yes| TEN
  SUB -->|no| FAIL
  DEST --> PUB[Published snapshot only / SSR]
  classDef deny fill:#ffe3e3,stroke:#b34141,color:#652121;
  class FAIL,SUSP deny
